WEBVTT

00:00:08.724 --> 00:00:10.434
Frankie, my boy! Look at you!

00:00:10.518 --> 00:00:12.812
Still traveling by mail, Mr. Cheapo, huh?

00:00:12.895 --> 00:00:14.063
It's not a money thing.

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:15.606
I have a plane phobia, okay?

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:17.650
I mean, at any moment,
those engines could catch...

00:00:17.733 --> 00:00:19.193
Fire! Yeah, yeah.

00:00:19.277 --> 00:00:20.611
"Fire bad."

00:00:20.695 --> 00:00:22.613
We know.

00:00:22.947 --> 00:00:25.116
Augustus, Porridge Head, come on!

00:00:25.199 --> 00:00:27.243
Does that look like Frankenstein's head?

00:00:27.451 --> 00:00:28.995
Hey, Drac, buddy, what's
going on with your cape there?

00:00:29.078 --> 00:00:30.163
What do you mean?

00:00:30.246 --> 00:00:31.539
Who pinched me?

00:00:31.622 --> 00:00:33.583
Guilty. You're irresistible.

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:35.877
Yes, very amusing, Invisible Man.

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:38.963
Hello. Great to "see" you.

00:00:39.672 --> 00:00:41.382
Never gets old.

00:00:43.634 --> 00:00:44.719
Missed me.

00:00:45.595 --> 00:00:46.637
Missed me, missed me, missed me.

00:00:46.721 --> 00:00:48.806
Okay, you win. Hold this bacon.

00:00:48.890 --> 00:00:50.141
Why am I holding bacon...

00:00:51.267 --> 00:00:52.894
No! Get 'em off!

00:00:57.899 --> 00:01:00.735
Here comes the party!

00:01:01.319 --> 00:01:02.904
Hello, Murray!

00:01:02.987 --> 00:01:04.947
Drac, what's up, buddy?

00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:06.949
The sand, Murray, the sand!

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:08.326
Always with the sand.

00:01:10.536 --> 00:01:13.039
Wolfie! Wanda! Frank!

00:01:16.417 --> 00:01:17.543
I love this guy.

00:01:17.627 --> 00:01:19.337
He always bringing it full tilt.

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:20.713
You're looking skinny, too.

00:01:20.796 --> 00:01:22.590
Now that you're just a head.

00:01:22.673 --> 00:01:25.051
Okay, you'll pay for that.

00:01:27.178 --> 00:01:28.304
So what's up, Drac?

00:01:28.387 --> 00:01:30.306
The hotel is looking off the hook.

00:01:30.806 --> 00:01:32.725
Hey, guys, watch this.

00:01:35.478 --> 00:01:37.146
By the way, you were right
about those directions.

00:01:37.188 --> 00:01:38.231
Oh, good, good.

00:01:38.522 --> 00:01:40.107
Yeah, I took the Tigris

00:01:40.191 --> 00:01:43.069
through the Nile, and there
was absolutely no traffic.

00:01:49.492 --> 00:01:50.660
You're kidding me.

00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:52.078
Right in my lobby?

00:01:52.161 --> 00:01:54.747
Drac, I swear, man, I don't run like that.

00:01:56.332 --> 00:01:57.416
Housekeeping!

00:02:04.423 --> 00:02:06.884
I was not the cause of that.

00:02:09.011 --> 00:02:10.221
We're ready!

00:02:14.308 --> 00:02:16.644
If only Martha were here to see this.

00:02:16.727 --> 00:02:18.980
She's always here, Wanda.

00:02:19.188 --> 00:02:20.564
Okay, friends,

00:02:20.648 --> 00:02:23.734
I am so glad you are here to celebrate.

00:02:23.818 --> 00:02:26.988
Another birthday for my sweet little Mavis,

00:02:27.071 --> 00:02:31.742
and another successful year
of refuge from them!

00:02:33.494 --> 00:02:35.246
These are recent human images

00:02:35.329 --> 00:02:37.498
our surveillance has uncovered.

00:02:37.581 --> 00:02:40.835
They are getting fatter so as to overpower us.

00:02:40.918 --> 00:02:42.837
And they are wearing less clothing,

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:45.089
allowing more movement to strangle us

00:02:45.131 --> 00:02:48.259
or cut open our heads and put candy in them.

00:02:48.301 --> 00:02:49.802
But they will never

00:02:49.927 --> 00:02:51.137
find us here.

00:02:51.262 --> 00:02:53.556
Evil villain, you will never win!

00:02:53.597 --> 00:02:56.309
Okie doke. The fun starts in 30 minutes.

00:02:56.434 --> 00:02:58.477
Right now, I have to see my little girl.

00:02:58.602 --> 00:03:00.396
She's not so little anymore!

00:03:00.438 --> 00:03:01.564
Yes, she is!

00:03:05.234 --> 00:03:06.444
What's going on out there?

00:03:06.485 --> 00:03:08.070
Are we at the hotel?

00:03:08.112 --> 00:03:11.282
Frank, did you book us
for a tandem massage?

00:03:11.324 --> 00:03:13.492
Did you get us a table at Hunchback's?

00:03:13.617 --> 00:03:15.119
Did you do anything?

00:03:16.287 --> 00:03:17.580
You're welcome.

00:03:17.621 --> 00:03:18.664
What's going on?

00:03:19.999 --> 00:03:21.459
Dad, you said that

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:24.337
when I turned 118,
I could go out into the world

00:03:24.462 --> 00:03:27.340
like every other adult that gets
to come and go from this hotel.

00:03:27.465 --> 00:03:30.134
"But, Mavey Wavey, it's not safe."

00:03:30.176 --> 00:03:32.511
Dad, 30 years ago, you promised.

00:03:32.636 --> 00:03:34.472
I remember, we were both eating mice,

00:03:34.513 --> 00:03:36.932
and you specifically said
that you gave me your word.

00:03:40.853 --> 00:03:42.521
Do not disturb.

00:03:42.646 --> 00:03:43.814
-Do not disturb.
-Do not disturb.

00:03:43.939 --> 00:03:45.024
Do not disturb.

00:03:45.149 --> 00:03:46.442
-Do not disturb.
-Do not disturb.

00:03:46.484 --> 00:03:48.611
-Do not disturb.
-Good morning, Your Eminence.

00:03:48.652 --> 00:03:50.821
Maid, clean up this room!

00:03:52.156 --> 00:03:54.700
It's you. Glad you could make it.

00:03:54.825 --> 00:03:56.994
-Is she up yet?
-She's up.

00:03:57.036 --> 00:04:01.665
She's ready to go. And by "go," I mean go.
As in, go check the world out.

00:04:01.791 --> 00:04:03.709
What you gonna do? What you gonna say?

00:04:03.834 --> 00:04:07.213
I got it covered. Please, relax.
Just do your job.

00:04:08.297 --> 00:04:10.174
Good morning, Mavey Wavey!

00:04:10.299 --> 00:04:12.218
Happy birthday, my little mouse!

00:04:12.343 --> 00:04:13.511
Thank you, Dad.

00:04:13.552 --> 00:04:15.221
I know it's my birthday.

00:04:15.346 --> 00:04:17.848
I have so much fun planned.

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:20.726
But first, we go catch
some scorpions together,

00:04:20.851 --> 00:04:22.561
just the two of us, yes, dead-ums?

00:04:22.686 --> 00:04:24.730
Dad, please, let me speak.

00:04:24.855 --> 00:04:26.524
There's something we have to talk about.

00:04:26.565 --> 00:04:29.068
You want to go out into the world. You can.

00:04:30.236 --> 00:04:31.570
I knew you were gonna say that.

00:04:31.695 --> 00:04:33.531
But, Dad, you gave me your word,

00:04:33.572 --> 00:04:36.033
and you know that I know that
a Dracula's word is sacred.

00:04:36.158 --> 00:04:37.701
That our trust is the core of our...

00:04:37.827 --> 00:04:38.869
Wait, what?

00:04:38.994 --> 00:04:40.413
I said you can go.

00:04:40.538 --> 00:04:41.747
You're just playing with me.

00:04:41.872 --> 00:04:44.417
No, no, no, no.
You're old enough to drive a hearse now,

00:04:44.542 --> 00:04:46.544
you're old enough to
make your own choices.

00:04:46.585 --> 00:04:47.878
You can go.

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:50.714
Holy rabies! Holy rabies!

00:04:56.053 --> 00:04:57.221
Whoa. Stop.

00:04:57.263 --> 00:04:59.056
Wait a second, sweetfangs.

00:04:59.181 --> 00:05:00.558
Where are you going?

00:05:00.599 --> 00:05:02.518
Oh, well, I'm going to paradise,

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:04.895
and this is just some stuff
that I thought I would need.

00:05:05.020 --> 00:05:07.231
-Paradise?
-Yeah, you know.

00:05:07.356 --> 00:05:09.692
It's that place out there
where you and Mom met.

00:05:10.067 --> 00:05:11.235
Auntie Wanda says you two

00:05:11.360 --> 00:05:13.279
were just like, Zing!

00:05:13.404 --> 00:05:14.947
I don't know from "Zing."

00:05:15.072 --> 00:05:16.866
Where did you find that card?

00:05:16.907 --> 00:05:18.409
In one of your drawers.

00:05:18.534 --> 00:05:20.369
Why won't you ever tell me
about how you met?

00:05:20.411 --> 00:05:21.912
It's actually Hawaii.

00:05:22.037 --> 00:05:23.080
Ha-what-what?

00:05:23.789 --> 00:05:26.292
Look, honey, I know you're excited,

00:05:26.417 --> 00:05:29.962
but everyone has gone to great lengths
to come see you on your birthday.

00:05:30.463 --> 00:05:32.590
I know. They always do.

00:05:32.923 --> 00:05:35.551
But aren't I getting a little old
for these parties?

00:05:35.593 --> 00:05:39.388
I love them,
but I really want to see new things.

00:05:39.430 --> 00:05:41.557
Maybe meet somebody my age.

00:05:42.892 --> 00:05:45.269
Come on. No, no, don't do that.

00:05:45.394 --> 00:05:47.897
Don't give me the pouty batface.

00:05:48.230 --> 00:05:52.818
Okay, there is a human village
just a little ways past the cemetery.

00:05:52.902 --> 00:05:55.988
You could go there and be back
in, like, 30 minutes or so.

00:05:56.071 --> 00:05:58.991
It should be plenty for your first time.

00:05:59.074 --> 00:06:01.952
Well, it's not Ha-wee-wee, but I guess

00:06:02.036 --> 00:06:04.663
it's still technically out there.

00:06:04.747 --> 00:06:06.999
Okay, okay, okay!

00:06:11.504 --> 00:06:12.755
Thanks for trusting me.

00:06:12.838 --> 00:06:14.507
Of course, my little one.

00:06:14.590 --> 00:06:16.509
I gave you my word.

00:06:18.093 --> 00:06:19.303
Hey, honey!

00:06:19.386 --> 00:06:20.971
-Look at this!
-Hey, guys.

00:06:21.055 --> 00:06:22.932
You excited about tomorrow?

00:06:23.015 --> 00:06:24.642
Not as excited as I am right now.

00:06:24.725 --> 00:06:26.644
You're not gonna believe this,
but Dad is letting me

00:06:26.727 --> 00:06:28.479
go out on my own to see a human village!

00:06:28.562 --> 00:06:29.605
-What?
-No!

00:06:29.688 --> 00:06:31.774
Excuse me. Drac!

00:06:31.857 --> 00:06:32.983
Have you lost it?

00:06:33.067 --> 00:06:34.652
Letting your own daughter out there

00:06:34.735 --> 00:06:37.238
with those horrible humans
you always tell us about?

00:06:37.321 --> 00:06:39.406
That's why you built this place.

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:41.450
They hate us. They're vicious.

00:06:41.534 --> 00:06:43.369
And they're very loud!

00:06:43.452 --> 00:06:45.788
Auntie Eunice, maybe they've changed.

00:06:45.871 --> 00:06:48.541
I'm just gonna fly down
the street and see how it goes.

00:06:48.624 --> 00:06:50.501
Okay, honey, be safe.

00:06:50.584 --> 00:06:52.461
Bring warm clothes and a sword.

00:06:52.545 --> 00:06:53.796
And look out for pitchforks.

00:06:53.879 --> 00:06:56.131
Don't you let anyone
scoop your brains out, either.

00:06:56.215 --> 00:06:57.466
Maybe stay in the shadows.

00:06:57.550 --> 00:06:59.885
It's more fun to just
observe from under a house.

00:06:59.969 --> 00:07:01.762
Guys, guys. She can handle it.

00:07:01.845 --> 00:07:04.056
She's a Dracula, for Pete's sake.

00:07:04.139 --> 00:07:06.475
But seriously, watch out for fire.

00:07:06.559 --> 00:07:08.435
Fire bad.

00:07:18.487 --> 00:07:19.863
Bye, everyone.

